#: ../../source/api_SnapshotAgent.md:1
msgid "SnapshotAgent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_SnapshotAgent.md:3
msgid ""
"The `SnapshotAgent` provides a powerful way to record and replay HTTP "
"requests for testing purposes. It extends `MockAgent` to enable automatic"
" snapshot testing, eliminating the need to manually define mock "
"responses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_SnapshotAgent.md:5
msgid "Use Cases"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_SnapshotAgent.md:7
msgid ""
"**Integration Testing**: Record real API interactions and replay them in "
"tests"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_SnapshotAgent.md:8
msgid "**Offline Development**: Work with APIs without network connectivity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_SnapshotAgent.md:9
msgid "**Consistent Test Data**: Ensure tests use the same responses across runs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_SnapshotAgent.md:10
msgid "**API Contract Testing**: Capture and validate API behavior over time"
msgstr ""

