#: ../../source/api_SnapshotAgent.md:23
msgid ""
"**maxSnapshots** `Number` - Maximum number of snapshots to keep in "
"memory. Default: `Infinity`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_SnapshotAgent.md:24
msgid ""
"**autoFlush** `Boolean` - Whether to automatically save snapshots to "
"disk. Default: `false`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_SnapshotAgent.md:25
msgid ""
"**flushInterval** `Number` - Interval in milliseconds for auto-flush. "
"Default: `30000`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_SnapshotAgent.md:26
msgid ""
"**matchHeaders** `Array<String>` - Specific headers to include in request"
" matching. Default: all headers"
